+// (README.md "PC patches"; pc/hal/spu.c, pc/hal/soundfont.c.)  All of it is
+// off by default and under the parity profile; off, every added branch is
+// skipped and the output is the unpatched computation.
+//   interp     0 the console's 4-tap Gaussian, 1 4-point cubic (Catmull-Rom,
+//              same taps and latency), 2 8-tap Kaiser-windowed sinc (two
+//              samples later, cutoff scaled with the pitch)
+//   reverb_hq  a second reverb unit in floating point -- the same algorithm,
+//              addresses and 22.05 kHz rate, without the 16-bit storage and
